*.o
*.obj
*.d
*.dep
*.gcno
*.gcda
*.gcov
a.out

# CMake-generated files
**/build/
**/CMakeFiles/
**/CMakeCache.txt
**/cmake_install.cmake
**/CTestTestfile.cmake
